<section class="help-section" id="admin-help"><h2>Administrator guide</h2><div class="help-grid"><div><h3>Create and update records</h3><p>Use Create movie, Create person, or Create song in the matching catalog. Fields marked with * are required. Edit opens the record’s form; Save changes confirms the update.</p><p>For a movie, use People or Songs to attach records from the library, and More details for optional data. For a song, use Credits to manage its contributors. Choose the correct role, then save the connection.</p><p>Delete opens a confirmation page. Cancelling keeps the record. Confirming permanently deletes the record and its related database rows. Deleting a connection alone keeps the person or song in the library.</p></div><div><h3>Admin tools</h3><ul><li><a href="setup.php">Import data</a> accepts UTF-8 CSV without a header row, up to 5 MB and 10,000 records. The import page lists the column order. Invalid data rolls back the whole upload; existing native movie title/year pairs are skipped.</li><li><a href="sign_up.php">Create user account</a> creates a Member account. Email addresses must be unique. Passwords are never displayed after creation.</li><li><a href="add_movie_posters.php">Upload posters</a> connects image files to movies. Follow the file size and format requirements on that page.</li><li>Manage anagrams and base characters from the Movies or Games section. These editing tools are available only to administrators.</li></ul></div></div></section>
